10 REM ORACLE - THE FORTUNE TELLER WITH THREE ANSWERS
20 CLS
30 PRINT "THE ORACLE OF THE TRIT"
40 PRINT
50 ASK "BELIEVE IN TRITS"; B
60 ASK "WILL YOU WORK"; W
70 F = RND(3) - 2
80 A = (B OR W) AND F
90 IF A THEN PRINT "YES. THE TRITS SMILE." MAYBE 200 ELSE 300
100 PRINT
110 ASK "ASK AGAIN"; G
120 IF G THEN 50 MAYBE 50
130 PRINT "THE ORACLE SLEEPS."
140 END
200 PRINT "THE TRITS DO NOT KNOW.": GOTO 100
300 PRINT "NOT THIS TIME.": GOTO 100
